WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:08.062
Every day, your AI does real work.

2
00:00:08.605 --> 00:00:09.049
Code.

3
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:09.934
Tests.

4
00:00:10.161 --> 00:00:11.066
Spreadsheets.

5
00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:12.021
Research.

6
00:00:12.774 --> 00:00:13.820
But all you get is a bill.

7
00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:15.224
It tells you what it cost.

8
00:00:15.451 --> 00:00:16.320
Not what it's worth.

9
00:00:17.002 --> 00:00:17.883
So we asked:

10
00:00:18.205 --> 00:00:19.801
if a person did this work, what would

11
00:00:19.821 --> 00:00:20.431
you pay them?

12
00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.534
Introducing DANGO.

13
00:00:25.094 --> 00:00:27.968
Every step your AI takes, DANGO asks:

14
00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.431
who would you hire for this?

15
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.671
Code goes to a software engineer.

16
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.688
Charts, to a data analyst.

17
00:00:33.927 --> 00:00:35.091
Your cat's upset stomach?

18
00:00:35.307 --> 00:00:36.117
That's a doctor.

19
00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:38.934
Then it prices that time at real U.S.

20
00:00:38.954 --> 00:00:39.953
median wages.

21
00:00:40.752 --> 00:00:42.324
Your dango lives in the corner of your

22
00:00:42.344 --> 00:00:44.452
screen, and dresses for the job.

23
00:00:45.236 --> 00:00:47.351
Click it, and your whole office opens

24
00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:47.768
up.

25
00:00:48.019 --> 00:00:48.783
Who's working.

26
00:00:49.045 --> 00:00:49.761
Who's napping.

27
00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:50.964
Who's waiting on you.

28
00:00:51.772 --> 00:00:55.349
So far, my AI has done over thirty thousand

29
00:00:55.369 --> 00:00:57.165
dollars of work, for about seventeen

30
00:00:57.185 --> 00:00:58.632
hundred in model costs.

31
00:01:00.112 --> 00:01:03.411
Claude Code, Codex, DeepSeek and WorkBuddy,

32
00:01:03.485 --> 00:01:06.071
side by side, with no plugins and no

33
00:01:06.091 --> 00:01:06.677
setup.

34
00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:08.392
Now that you're the boss:

35
00:01:08.655 --> 00:01:09.701
what kind of boss are you?

36
00:01:09.999 --> 00:01:10.928
Four dimensions.

37
00:01:11.155 --> 00:01:12.249
Sixteen types.

38
00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.636
It reads your history and tells your

39
00:01:14.656 --> 00:01:15.266
story.

40
00:01:15.493 --> 00:01:16.374
Your latest night.

41
00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:17.530
Your biggest day.

42
00:01:17.769 --> 00:01:18.579
Your payslip.

43
00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:19.755
Me?

44
00:01:19.982 --> 00:01:21.076
Midnight CEO.

45
00:01:22.151 --> 00:01:23.664
Every report becomes a card you can

46
00:01:23.684 --> 00:01:24.305
share.

47
00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:26.286
And it all runs on your Mac.

48
00:01:26.513 --> 00:01:27.465
Nothing is uploaded.

49
00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.248
DANGO.

50
00:01:29.476 --> 00:01:30.522
Your AI works for you.

51
00:01:30.738 --> 00:01:31.619
Now you can see it.

52
00:01:32.614 --> 00:01:33.885
Get DANGO for your Mac,

53
00:01:33.959 --> 00:01:35.653
at dangoai.org.
